<title>UK: Depfa Bank sets 100 mln mark four-yr step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Depfa Bank sets 100 mln mark four-yr step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up Pfandbrief was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0 PCT   MATURITY  **16.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.975   PAY DATE   L15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125 PCT REOFFER    PAR	 L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.15 PCT  SELL CONC   0.975 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*IN YEARS ONE TO TWO, 6.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE AFTER TWO YEARS AND ONE DAY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
